hook-redactor src/patterns.rs: auth_header_matches_authorization_equals.
The Rust template inserts a space after '='; Go leaves the prefix as is.
-- input --
Authorization=eyJhbsomesecret
-- must_contain --
<redacted:api_key>
-- must_not_contain --
eyJhb
-- want --
Authorization=<redacted:api_key>
-- deviation --
prefix
